# THE EXACT NAME IS NOT ENOUGH. compose builds this image with the DEPLOYMENT folder as context, where an operator
# keeps backups beside the file (`cp .env .env.bak-2026-11-06` before an edit) -- each one holds every credential .env
# does. Measured on the 253 deployment: the image built there carried four of them, one made minutes before the
# build, because `.env` matched none of them. The variants are excluded here and the shipped example is kept.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
npm-debug.log
